AB  - With medical health disorders increasing their share of burdens towards the comprehensive burden of diseases, as per the World Health Organization (WHO), the disorder may account for 13% of the total illness by 2030 [1]. Inspire of this critical situation, the field has been continuously facing challenges. Be it social or be it limited access to resources, which may lead to delayed diagnosis. This research successfully presents an Artificial Intelligence based Expert System harnessed by the capabilities of large Language Models (LLMs) and backed by the highly efficient and reliable advanced Continuous-integration and Continuous-Delivery Mechanism (CI/CD) pipeline. The model’s robust AI based training shall help in simulating highly accurate Psychiatric-based decision making. CI/CD shall hold the responsibility of uninterrupted management of the model with the capabilities of Version Control, error-tracking, continuous deployment in minimal outage/downtime.
